  "description": "Our Product Regulatory and Compliance Standards Advisor provides Design Engineers, Product Managers and Supply Chain NPI Coordinators an intelligent and automated way to validate regulatory standards and compliance policies throughout a products lifecycle. The AI advisor Standards answer any questions a user may have on these regulations and standards in context of a specific item. It can validate the item operational and extended attribute values for regulatory compliance.",
